+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project Overview
+
+This is an **A2A Stock Analysis Multi-Agent System** - a comprehensive stock analysis platform using Google's Agent-to-Agent (A2A) protocol with specialized AI agents. The system demonstrates multi-agent coordination where a Host Agent orchestrates 4 specialized A2A agents (Technical, Fundamental, Sentiment, Risk) to provide comprehensive stock analysis.
+
+**Tech Stack:**
+- **A2A Protocol**: Agent-to-agent communication (SDK: `a2a-sdk`)
+- **Google ADK**: Agent Development Kit for building agents
+- **Mesop**: Web UI framework for the demo interface
+- **Gemini 2.0**: Google's LLM (gemini-2.0-flash-001)
+- **MCP (Model Context Protocol)**: For real-time data fetching via `yfmcp` (Yahoo Finance)
+- **UV**: Package manager and workspace orchestrator
+- **Python 3.12+**: Required runtime
+
+## Common Development Commands
+
+### Start/Stop Services
+
+```bash
+# Start all services (UI + 4 agents)
+./run_all.sh
+
+# Stop all services
+./stop_all.sh
+
+# View logs
+tail -f /tmp/demo_ui.log           # UI logs
+tail -f /tmp/technical_analyst.log  # Technical Analyst logs
+tail -f /tmp/fundamental_analyst.log
+tail -f /tmp/sentiment_analyst.log
+tail -f /tmp/risk_assessor.log
+```
+
+### Manual Service Execution
+
+```bash
+# Terminal 1: Demo UI (Port 12000)
+cd demo/ui
+uv run main.py
+
+# Terminal 2-5: Individual Agents
+cd agents/technical_analyst && uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10101
+cd agents/fundamental_analyst && uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10102
+cd agents/sentiment_analyst && uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10103
+cd agents/risk_assessor && uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10104
+```
+
+### Verification
+
+```bash
+# Check if services are running
+lsof -i :12000  # Demo UI
+lsof -i :10101  # Technical Analyst
+lsof -i :10102  # Fundamental Analyst
+lsof -i :10103  # Sentiment Analyst
+lsof -i :10104  # Risk Assessor
+
+# Verify agent card accessibility
+curl http://localhost:10101/.well-known/agent-card.json
+```
+
+## Architecture Overview
+
+### 3-Tier Architecture
+
+```
+User → Demo UI (Mesop) → Host Agent (ADK)
+                            ↓
+        ┌──────────────────┴──────────────────┐
+        ├── Technical Analyst (A2A :10101)    │
+        ├── Fundamental Analyst (A2A :10102)  │
+        ├── Sentiment Analyst (A2A :10103)    │
+        └── Risk Assessor (A2A :10104)        │
+                            ↓
+                      MCP Server (yfmcp)
+                            ↓
+                      Yahoo Finance API
+```
+
+**Key Distinction:**
+- **Host Agent**: Orchestrator using ADK, coordinates specialists, synthesizes reports
+- **4 Specialized A2A Agents**: Independent servers providing domain-specific analysis
+- **MCP Server**: External data provider (not part of this codebase, runs separately)
+
+### Agent Responsibilities
+
+1. **Host Agent** (`hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py`):
+   - Receives user requests via Mesop UI
+   - Identifies stock ticker from company name or symbol
+   - Delegates analysis to 4 specialists **in parallel** using `send_messages_parallel()`
+   - Synthesizes comprehensive report in Korean (한국어)
+   - Returns unified analysis to user
+
+2. **Technical Analyst** (Port 10101):
+   - Chart patterns, RSI, MACD, Moving Averages
+   - Support/resistance levels, entry/exit points
+   - Uses MCP tools to fetch price history
+
+3. **Fundamental Analyst** (Port 10102):
+   - P/E ratios, earnings, revenue growth, financial health
+   - ROE, ROA, valuation metrics
+   - Uses MCP tools to fetch financial statements
+
+4. **Sentiment Analyst** (Port 10103):
+   - News sentiment, analyst ratings, market mood
+   - Social media buzz, upcoming catalysts
+   - Uses MCP tools to fetch news and analyst recommendations
+
+5. **Risk Assessor** (Port 10104):
+   - Volatility, beta, VIX context, maximum drawdown
+   - Portfolio fit, position sizing recommendations
+   - Uses MCP tools to fetch risk metrics
+
+### Data Flow
+
+1. User asks: "삼성전자 주가 분석해줘" via UI (http://localhost:12000)
+2. Host Agent receives request, identifies ticker: `005930.KS`
+3. Host Agent calls `send_messages_parallel(ticker="005930.KS")`
+4. **Parallel execution**: All 4 agents query simultaneously (~13 seconds)
+5. Each agent uses MCP tools to fetch Yahoo Finance data
+6. Host Agent receives 4 reports and synthesizes comprehensive analysis
+7. User sees unified report in Korean with all perspectives
+
+## Important Implementation Details
+
+### Parallel Execution (Critical Performance Optimization)
+
+The Host Agent has two delegation methods:
+
+- `send_message(agent_name, message)`: Sequential execution (slow, ~40 seconds for 4 agents)
+- `send_messages_parallel(ticker)`: **Parallel execution** (fast, ~13 seconds) ← **USE THIS**
+
+**The system is designed to use `send_messages_parallel()` for all stock analysis requests.**
+
+File: `hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py:386-505`
+
+### JSON Extraction Pattern
+
+Each specialized agent returns **markdown analysis + JSON block**:
+
+```python
+# Agent response format (agents/*/agent.py)
+"""
+[Detailed markdown analysis here]
+
+```json
+{
+  "ticker": "AAPL",
+  "current_price": 150.25,
+  "trend": "Bullish",
+  ...
+  "analysis_content": "Full markdown report here"
+}
+```
+"""
+```
+
+The Host Agent extracts JSON from agent responses using regex:
+`hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py:518-530` (in `convert_part()`)
+
+### Retry Logic with Exponential Backoff
+
+To handle API quota exhaustion (429 errors), the system implements exponential backoff:
+
+File: `hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py:418-482`
+
+- Max retries: 3
+- Base delay: 2 seconds
+- Exponential backoff: 2s → 4s → 8s
+- Handles: 429, ResourceExhausted, Timeout errors
+
+### Korean Language Output
+
+The Host Agent **always responds in Korean (한국어)** regardless of input language. This is enforced in the root instruction:
+
+File: `hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py:114-257`
+
+### Ticker Symbol Resolution
+
+The Host Agent intelligently maps company names to tickers:
+
+- Apple, 애플 → `AAPL`
+- 삼성전자 → `005930.KS` (Korean stocks require `.KS` suffix)
+- CoreWeave, 코어위브 → `CRWV`
+
+File: `hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py:135-160`
+
+## Workspace Structure (UV Monorepo)
+
+```
+my-a2a-project/
+├── pyproject.toml              # Workspace root (defines members)
+├── .env                        # API keys (not committed)
+├── demo/ui/                    # Mesop web interface
+├── hosts/multiagent/           # Host Agent (orchestrator)
+├── agents/                     # 4 specialized A2A agents
+│   ├── technical_analyst/
+│   ├── fundamental_analyst/
+│   ├── sentiment_analyst/
+│   └── risk_assessor/
+├── extensions/timestamp/       # Timestamp extension for A2A messages
+├── docs/                       # Architecture documentation
+│   ├── AGENT_ARCHITECTURE.md   # Business logic & workflow
+│   └── SYSTEM_DESIGN.md        # Technical implementation
+├── run_all.sh                  # Startup script
+└── stop_all.sh                 # Shutdown script
+```
+
+**Workspace members** (defined in root `pyproject.toml`):
+- `demo/ui`
+- `hosts/multiagent`
+- `agents/technical_analyst`
+- `agents/fundamental_analyst`
+- `agents/sentiment_analyst`
+- `agents/risk_assessor`
+- `extensions/timestamp`
+
+Each member has its own `pyproject.toml` with specific dependencies.
+
+## Environment Variables
+
+Required file: `demo/ui/.env`
+
+```bash
+# Required
+GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here  # Get from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
+
+# Optional
+LITELLM_MODEL=gemini/gemini-2.0-flash-001
+A2A_UI_HOST=0.0.0.0
+A2A_UI_PORT=12000
+```
+
+## Key Files to Modify
+
+When making changes, focus on these files:
+
+1. **Host Agent Logic**: `hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py`
+   - Orchestration logic
+   - Ticker resolution
+   - Synthesis instructions
+   - Parallel execution
+
+2. **Individual Agent Prompts**: `agents/*/agent.py`
+   - Analysis framework
+   - Output format
+   - MCP tool configuration
+
+3. **UI**: `demo/ui/main.py` and `demo/ui/service/`
+   - User interface
+   - Agent registration
+
+4. **Startup Scripts**: `run_all.sh`, `stop_all.sh`
+   - Service orchestration
+
+## Agent Registration
+
+Agents must be registered in the UI after startup:
+
+1. Open http://localhost:12000
+2. Click the robot icon 🤖
+3. Add each agent address:
+   - `localhost:10101` (Technical Analyst)
+   - `localhost:10102` (Fundamental Analyst)
+   - `localhost:10103` (Sentiment Analyst)
+   - `localhost:10104` (Risk Assessor)
+
+Each agent exposes an A2A agent card at `/.well-known/agent-card.json`.
+
